  Context & Purpose:
  This is a comprehensive 12-week fitness program created by Pete Ryan, a two-time British
  kickboxing champion with 18 years of personal training experience. The program targets busy
  professionals and includes ADHD-friendly strategies.

  Current Structure:
  - 12-week program divided into 4 phases (Foundation, Strength & Skill, Hypertrophy &
